<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">What MLLMs Learn about When they
<br class="ltx_break">Learn about Multimodal Reasoning:
<br class="ltx_break">Perception, Reasoning, or their Integration?</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
