<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Models.</h4>

<div id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Details of the model configurations and corresponding sources are provided in <a href="#A4.T1" title="In Models. ‣ Appendix D Implementation Details and resources ‣ What MLLMs Learn about When theyLearn about Multimodal Reasoning:Perception, Reasoning, or their Integration?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
